// An immutable binding to a context-free polymorphic literal (`[]`) has no way to determine its
// element type and is not annotated — a compile-time `E0023`. The fix is an annotation
// (`xs: List<int> = []`) or a `mut` accumulator whose later writes supply the type. Both backends
// reject it identically (the checker is shared).
// expect: error E0023 at 7:6
// expect: exit 1
xs = [];
echo xs;
